r=a7.oF("1. Data Minimization & Local Disk Isolation")
q=a7.kq(B.FL,"Zero Centralized Clouds","We do not operate, own, or lease centralized cloud databases to capture, aggregate, or profile your personal data, app usage habits, or behavioral analytics.")
p=a7.kq(B.FF,"Sandbox Security","All application assets, databases, user configurations, and transaction records are stored strictly within the secure local storage directory of your physical device.")
o=a7.kq(B.FO,"Account-Free Operation","Access to our software utilities requires no registration, identity disclosure, phone linking, or authentication with remote servers.")
n=a7.oF("2. Omni-Channel P2P Transport & Fallback Topologies")
