k=a7.r2("Layer 3 (Bluetooth Classic / LE)","Low-frequency, extreme close-range communication falls back to low-power Bluetooth channels for metadata exchanges and state synchronizations.")
j=a7.r2("Tor Network Routing","Selected public-facing or external endpoints leverage multi-hop Tor onion routing to mask device IP addresses, locations, and structural network metadata.")
i=a7.r2("Delay-Tolerant Networking (DTN)",'For highly volatile or intermittent topologies, we utilize a decentralized "store-carry-forward" protocol. Encrypted payloads may be cached locally inside secure storage buffers and securely hopped across intermediate peer nodes. These intermediate nodes act as blind relays and cannot decrypt, alter, or view your payloads.')
h=a7.oF("3. Edge AI & On-Device Local LLM Orchestration")
g=a7.kq(B.FN,"Zero Cloud Inference","All AI inferences, text processing, search lookups, and orchestration tasks are executed locally on your device's native CPU/GPU/NPU using highly optimized, low-power quantized weights. No prompt data, context windows, or outputs are ever transmitted to external web services.")
f=a7.kq(B.FR,"Deep App Linking Security","The local AI agent functions as an offline orchestrator, routing contextual actions safely between our ecosystem applications using secure, local Deep App Links. Inter-app communication occurs entirely within the device\u2019s operating system memory space.")
e=a7.oF("4. IoT Hardware & Environmental Sensing Connections")
d=a7.kq(B.FP,"Local Hardware Boundary","Data exchanged with our custom IoT equipment is transmitted entirely over local hardware loops (Bluetooth LE, local network sockets, or physical serial connections).")
c=a7.kq(B.FC,"No Remote Telemetry","Environmental sensor logs, hardware states, and telemetry data collected by connected IoT components remain isolated to the local mesh and are never uploaded to remote telemetry clouds.")
b=a7.oF("5. Green Software & Computing Commitments")
a=a7.kq(B.FM,"Minimal Power Draw","By discarding persistent cloud sync polling, cloud database handshakes, and remote telemetry pings, we drastically drop device radio battery drainage and idle CPU cycles.")
a0=a7.kq(B.FQ,"Algorithmic Efficiency","Our edge processing models and compiled Go binaries are engineered to run within narrow memory footprints, preventing thermal throttling and extending the physical lifespan of consumer mobile and desktop hardware.")
